algorithms.pseudocode:
Input: Weight matrix W[n][n]
Output: All-pairs shortest-path matrix D[n][n]

D = copy(W)
for k = 0 to n-1:
    for i = 0 to n-1:
        for j = 0 to n-1:
            D[i][j] = min(D[i][j], D[i][k] + D[k][j])
return D

Complexity: O(n³) time, O(n²) space
Interpretation: Computes tropical matrix closure W* = I ⊕ W ⊕ W² ⊕ ...
